WEBVTT

00:04:29.668 --> 00:04:32.292
at least he would have
some sense of progress.

00:04:32.316 --> 00:04:35.000
Also, if you look at prison movies,

00:04:35.024 --> 00:04:38.183
sometimes the way that the guards
torture the prisoners

00:04:38.207 --> 00:04:41.842
is to get them to dig a hole,
and when the prisoner is finished,

00:04:41.866 --> 00:04:44.865
they ask him to fill the hole
back up and then dig again.

00:04:44.889 --> 00:04:47.071
There's something
about this cyclical version

00:04:47.095 --> 00:04:49.710
of doing something over and over and over

00:04:49.734 --> 00:04:52.187
that seems to be
particularly demotivating.

00:04:52.575 --> 00:04:54.782
So in the second condition
of this experiment,

00:04:54.806 --> 00:04:56.472
that's exactly what we did.

00:04:56.496 --> 00:04:57.783
We asked people,

00:04:57.807 --> 00:05:00.966
"Would you like to build
one Bionicle for three dollars?"